MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2092541973}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9cbad53b7b0db54419eb38839c40d433, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  menuName: {fileID: 44055878}
  enterButton: {fileID: 661768476}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1437531853}
  endingText: {fileID: 143290934}
  panel: {fileID: 591471075}
  talkingSFX: {fileID: 1145855725}
  speechBubble: {fileID: 965008647}
  dialogue:
  - Sometimes I think I see things in the static.
  - Faces, people, places, the usual.
  - I didn't realise anything was wrong at first.
  - Not until it started talking, at least.
  - ...
  - Do you remember that game we used to play together?
  - On the console when we were young?
  - Sometimes I see that too.
  - But when I pick up the controller to play I have no input.
  - No control.
  - I just watch as the character nosedives into the same pit, over and over.
  - The same message flickering back at me each time.
  - '"GAME OVER".'
  - ...
  - I'm going back.
  - I don't think I can justify doing this anymore.
  - Not when I'm like this.
  - Maybe I'll see you while I'm there.
  - I guess it doesn't matter though.
  - You'll follow me through the static wherever I go.
